			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync submodules for debug server and SCM diff support\n\nSynchronize the Land editor architecture by updating `Documentation/Rust` and `Land/Element` submodules to their latest development states.\n\nKey updates include:\n- **Element Submodules**: Implement a dual-layer DebugServer (ports 9933/9934) in Mountain and Cocoon for independent Rust and Node.js introspection. Add full SCM diff command handling (`$scm:openDiff`, `vscode.diff`) to restore the round-trip IPC contract for diff operations.\n- **Output**: Introduce `InjectWebviewBlobUrlRewrite` to resolve WKWebView cross-protocol security failures by converting `vscode-*` schemes to stable blob URLs.\n- **Documentation**: Initialize Rust documentation roots (README.md) across Air, Common, Echo, Mist, Rest, and SideCar.\n- **Maintenance**: Standardize whitespace in ESBuild configs and update dev dependencies.\n\nThese changes fix critical webview rendering issues, restore full debuggability across the stack, and establish the foundational documentation structure.",
			"SHA": "47530f9e7c3d621c3c38343fabeabc82790f9343"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-18T00:33:22Z",
			"File": [
				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				128,
				11
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Project): Rebrand application identity to FIDDEE and solidify config pipeline\n\nExecute a comprehensive rebranding of the editor from \"Land\" to the internal codename \"FIDDEE\" across all submodules and build pipelines. This update replaces application identifiers, bundle names, telemetry keys, data directories, and URI schemes to align with the new product identity.\n\nKey modifications include:\n- **Product Identity**: Update `.env.Land.Sample` and `ResolveProductConfig.sh` defaults to use \"FIDDEE\" and \"fiddee\" variants.\n- **Codegen Pipeline**: Introduce `ResolveIdentity.ts` and `ResolveIdentity.sh` to fan out the authoritative `product.json` from `Element/Sky/Public` to `Mountain`, `Sky`, and `Output` targets. This ensures a single source of truth for identity constants.\n- **Build Integration**: Wire the new identity resolution step into `Maintain/Debug/Build.sh` and `Maintain/Release/Build.sh`.\n- **Submodule Sync**: Update `Element` submodule to apply the \"FIDDEE\" identity across Tauri configs, manifest files, and telemetry bridges.\n- **Build Quality**: Fix JSON serialization whitespace (tabs vs spaces) in `Sync.ts`, `ResolveProductConfig.sh`, and `PostHogCapture.sh` to ensure consistent artifact generation.\n- **Configuration**: Update `turbo.json` to recognize new environment variables and remove deprecated dependencies.\n\nThis ensures the entire stack, from native backend to UI and telemetry, consistently identifies as FIDDEE without modifying upstream Microsoft source code.",
